Package: libomt
Architecture: amd64 arm64
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, ${shlibs:Depends}, ${libomt:Icu}, libavahi-client3
Description: Open Media Transport runtime library, for CasparCG Server
 libomt is the C library of Open Media Transport (OMT), a protocol for sending
 video and audio with low latency over a local network. libvmx is the video
 codec that it uses.
 .
 CasparCG Server loads libomt for its OMT consumer and producer. Install this
 package to enable OMT in the server, no rebuild of the server is needed.
